<p class="rounded-md border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs"><strong>Where is the Import button?</strong> Two places: on <strong>Species</strong>, tick species and use <strong>Import from GBIF</strong> above the table; or on a species’ own page, the green <strong>Import from GBIF</strong> button top right. Both need the <strong>Update GBIF</strong> permission – an Admin can grant it in <strong>Users</strong>. Without it the button is greyed out.</p>
